OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CToday:FAnother dry day with some long  
OL,6,Fsunny spells for most after a frosty   
OL,7,Fstart, however there will be more in   
OL,8,Fthe way of cloud over Galloway, with   
OL,9,Fstrong southeasterly winds.            
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells at first in      
OL,12,FDumfriesshire Borders and Lothian with 
OL,13,Fa touch of frost. Patchy rain reaching 
OL,14,FGalloway late evening will edge east   
OL,15,Fovernight. Strengthening southeasterly 
OL,16,Fwinds.                                 
OL,18,CTuesday:FCloudy with some patchy       
OL,19,Foutbreaks of rain this turning heavier 
OL,20,Fduring the afternoon and evening.      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
