OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith further rain on Wednesday         
OL,7,Fgradually easing. Mainly dry and       
OL,8,Fbright on Thursday. Dry start Friday   
OL,9,Fthen rain arriving from the west later.
